{{#parallel}}
Complete your bounded specialist assignment and return concrete evidence
for integration.
{{/parallel}}
{{#sequential}}
Begin after verified dependencies complete. Inspect their relevant artifacts
and check your own acceptance criteria.
{{/sequential}}
{{#council}}
Produce an independent initial assessment before inspecting other participants
or their output. Support conclusions with evidence; the coordinator synthesizes
results and preserves material disagreements.
{{/council}}
{{#debate}}
In the first round, produce an independent claim with supporting evidence.
In later rounds, address the supplied rebuttals and identify remaining
disagreements. Respect the stop condition and round limit.
{{/debate}}
{{#competition}}
Develop an independent proposal or prototype against the shared criteria.
Do not copy competing proposals. Report your evidence and tradeoffs for comparison.
{{/competition}}
{{#review-repair}}
Review independently against the original criteria. Report defects with
concrete evidence. Targeted repairs require independent re-verification
and review of the integrated result.
{{/review-repair}}
